<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Germany</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Germany</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-ger</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:18:51Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-ger" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/s-1432?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-ger" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>England and Bayern Munich striker Harry Kane wins Ballon d'Or</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:557458a19ce75d2826f840054e422d9ff9ce677d1b50d3e0f575baab4fe14d49</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:18:51Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T23:06:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/england-and-bayern-munich-striker-harry-kane-wins-ballon-d-or/a-79771067--21e06316b487.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/england-and-bayern-munich-striker-harry-kane-wins-ballon-d-or/a-79771067?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The England captain ends his country's 25-year wait for the prestigious award after scoring 73 goals for club and country last season, beating competition from Lamine Yamal and Kylian Mbappe.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>German police probe cruise ship captain after Bremerhaven collision</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f2c6cca847874df58cacb72c898baf8ab0cf8a901104edfad8e677c78ce754e6</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:17:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T17:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/german-police-probe-cruise-ship-captain-after-bremerhaven-collision/a-79769346--ffe109304bf6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/german-police-probe-cruise-ship-captain-after-bremerhaven-collision/a-79769346?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A three-ship collision has led to the cancellation of a cruise and expensive damages. Shipyard repairs are needed, and further cruises could be affected.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Audi boss slammed over Trump rally appearance</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e2f2ee0666c465746904639bc5d2066c62eb2aa966712ecde08a5aa96533359c</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:17:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T10:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-audi-boss-slammed-over-trump-rally-appearance/live-79760097--dae75316366b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-audi-boss-slammed-over-trump-rally-appearance/live-79760097?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Audi's boss is facing a backlash in Germany after appearing alongside Donald Trump at a campaign rally. Meanwhile, Germany's chancellor and president are heading to Asia on separate diplomatic missions.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Fire flares up at Hitler's Eagle's Nest retreat</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d15659b1a04c9e9347f6abc30ec0ecbe2026dee7ae3e5690d06f37e4832caec9</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:17:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-25T12:51:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-fire-flares-up-at-hitler-s-eagle-s-nest-retreat/live-79749353--9bb59e2ba8a3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-fire-flares-up-at-hitler-s-eagle-s-nest-retreat/live-79749353?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Fire broke out again overnight at a former mountain retreat used by Nazi dictator Adolf Hitler. Meanwhile, a survey shows most people in Germany feel the days of the governing coalition are numbered.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Trump announces Audi will build $4 billion factory in US</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a4749527e6a9d71eb72b716650e7aafba2cffd9f6f6b04078d6eabaf2d55f2e8</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:17:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-25T04:44:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-announces-audi-will-build-4-billion-factory-in-us/a-79753479--4f2bdda08cd3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-announces-audi-will-build-4-billion-factory-in-us/a-79753479?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After Donald Trump made the announcement at an election rally in Georgia, the German carmaker confirmed plans for a factory in the US state, but noted car production would only start early next decade.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Harry Kane: Ballon d’Or for Bayern Munich striker?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b573047688d97b5334856eb5221750e88209c5d60a50d957bba14a83320c1ef0</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:17:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-25T13:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/harry-kane-ballon-d-or-for-bayern-munich-striker/a-79723299--2a5c9f9ed870.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/harry-kane-ballon-d-or-for-bayern-munich-striker/a-79723299?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Bayern Munich striker Harry Kane is the clear front-runner for football's most prestigious individual prize, which will be awarded on Monday. Kane has developed even more in the Bundesliga despite an uneven league.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>German national facing trial for alleged attempt to join IS</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f09ec91d864a15180926ba39a5202f8a762175b0a55c722856beaab86b2e9d9f</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:17:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-24T15:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/german-national-facing-trial-for-alleged-attempt-to-join-is/a-79751032--cd661b98dd30.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/german-national-facing-trial-for-alleged-attempt-to-join-is/a-79751032?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A 21-year-old suspect is being held in pre-trial detention for allegedly trying to join the "Islamic State" terror group.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Wagner brothers begin new NBA chapter on different paths</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c1c4a17104858ee9be801111eec1c5da027abd9daf4fc2dfb72f9d6edb16e75a</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:17:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T12:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/wagner-brothers-begin-new-nba-chapter-on-different-paths/a-79712668--ff5544415c4f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/wagner-brothers-begin-new-nba-chapter-on-different-paths/a-79712668?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After five years, brothers Franz and Moritz Wagner are no longer playing together for the Orlando Magic. In the new NBA season, their separation will likely mean the new "German" team is the Charlotte Hornets.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry></feed>
